Use "fetch" tool for full page/database contents after getting search results. For Notion results, pass the result's "id" field to fetch tool's "id" param. Set page_size (default 10, max 25) and max_highlight_length (default 200, 0 to omit) as low as possible to minimize response size.
To search within a database: First fetch the database to get the data source URL (collectio[REDACTED_LOCAL_PATH] from <data-source url="..."> tags, then use that as data_source_url. For multi-source databases, match by view ID (?v=...) in URL or search all sources separately.
